export anchor HealthcareSaaSStyle:
    number: 185
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Healthcare SaaS
    idea: A calm, reassuring workspace in soft teal with 8px corners, roomy spacing and plain sentences, so the busiest day still feels under control.
    base: light
    palette:
        teal: #0f766e, the primary button, progress fills, this week bars, timeline rings and focus
        deepTeal: #115e59, current nav text, links, the avatar and style sheet headings
        tealTint: #e3f2f0, the current nav item, KPI icon discs and last week bars
        calm: #eef6f5, progress bar tracks
        page: #f3f7f7, the page background
        white: #ffffff, the side rail, cards and fields
        ink: #1d2b2e, text
        muted: #4f6266, plain sentences, meta and axis labels
        line: #dbe6e5, card, row and timeline lines
        onTrack: #1a7a43, On track on #e6f4ec with a check in a circle
        atRisk: #8f5200, At risk on #fdf1de with a triangle and bang, also the overdue notice
        behind: #b42318, Behind on #fdecea with a cross in a diamond
    type:
        One stack, system-ui, apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial. KPI figures 40px at 650, the greeting 30px at 650,
        card titles 20px at 650, project names 17px at 650, body 16px at
        1.6, meta 14px and status pills 14px at 600.
    layout:
        A white left rail 248px wide holds the brand with a teal rounded
        square mark, then six nav items with 20px line icons, Home filled
        teal tint. The main area starts with a roomy row of a wide search
        field, a teal New project button, a bell and the avatar with Mara
        Okafor. A white welcome card has Hello, Mara and the date at left
        and a soft amber notice at right with a triangle, 4 tasks are
        overdue in bold and a gentle line to open Tasks when ready. Next is
        one wide white card split into four KPI cells by thin dividers,
        each with an icon in a teal tint disc, the label, a 40px figure and
        a short plain caption such as tasks are past their date, the
        overdue disc amber. Below sits a grid of 1.7 to 1. The left card,
        Your projects, lists each project as a bordered row with name and
        team, a status pill at right, a 10px full width bar and a sentence
        such as 72% done. 18 of 25 tasks finished. Due 14 Nov, in 14 days.
        The right card, What happened recently, is a vertical timeline of
        teal ring dots joined by a grey line, each entry with the time
        below. A full width chart card closes the dashboard, with the title,
        the two week totals and a plain sentence at left and fourteen
        rounded bars at right, last week outlined in teal over tint and
        this week solid teal. Below 1100px the grid stacks and KPIs go two
        by two. Below 820px the rail turns into a wrapped row of nav pills
        without icons on top, cards lose padding, and the chart scrolls
        sideways inside its card.
    spacing: An 8px unit used generously. 32px between sections, 28px card padding, 48px tall controls, 40px page gutter.
    density: Low. One project per full width row, each with a sentence.
    corners: 8px on cards, rows, buttons, fields and nav items. Pills for status. Circles for icon discs and timeline dots.
    borders: 1px soft teal grey lines on cards and rows. Fields use a firmer 1px grey teal line.
    shadows: None. Calm comes from space and soft tints.
    icons:
        20px rounded line icons at 1.75 stroke, shown in teal tint discs on
        KPIs. Status icons are filled 18px shapes with a white mark, a
        circle with a check, a triangle with a bang and a diamond with a
        cross, inside tinted pills with the word.
    focus: A 3px teal outline offset 3px on every control. A focused field also turns its border teal.
    tone: Warm, plain and reassuring, full sentences such as 18 of 25 tasks finished and What happened recently.
